  "question": {
    "text": "Match the chemical conversions in List I with the appropriate reagents in List II and select the correct answer using the code given below the lists :<br />&nbsp;<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\"><strong>&nbsp;List - I&nbsp;</strong></td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\"><strong>&nbsp;List - II&nbsp;</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;(A)&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/EM0012657_Ques1_1..jpg\" style=\"opacity: 0.9; width: 241px; height: 65px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;(P)&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hg</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OAc</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>NaBH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;(B)&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>​<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/EM0012657_Ques1_2..jpg\" style=\"opacity: 0.9; width: 241px; height: 63px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;(Q)&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOEt</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;(C)&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/EM0012657_Ques1_3..jpg\" style=\"width: 241px; height: 52px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;(R)&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Et</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>Br</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;(D)&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/EM0012657_Ques1_4..jpg\" style=\"width: 241px; height: 72px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;(S)&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>BH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mi>NaOH</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>",
